This module renders the [[Demonic Pacts League]] skill tree from data in
[[Module:Demonic Pacts/data]]. It is invoked by [[Template:Demonic Pacts Tree]]
and styled by [[MediaWiki:Common.less/templates.less]].

== Usage ==
Place the template anywhere on a page:

<pre>{{Demonic Pacts Tree}}</pre>

The renderer projects each node's raw coordinates into the canvas pixel space,
emits absolutely-positioned <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> elements for nodes and
rotated <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> lines for edges, then attaches a CSS-only
hover tooltip showing the effect text for each node.

== Functions ==
;<code>p.render(frame)</code>
:The single entry point. Reads all nodes and edges from
:[[Module:Demonic Pacts/data]] and returns a string of HTML.

== Layout constants ==
;<code>SIZE_PX</code>
:Display size of node containers in pixels for each <code>size</code> value
:(<code>sm</code>, <code>md</code>, <code>lg</code>). Adjust to make icons
:bigger or smaller. Source files are 120&#215;120 px so values up to 120 are
:rendered crisply.
;<code>CANVAS_W</code> and <code>CANVAS_H</code>
:Target dimensions of the canvas in pixels. The renderer chooses a uniform
:scale that fits the bounding box of all nodes inside this area.

== Updating data ==
To add or change a node, edit [[Module:Demonic Pacts/data]]. To upload a new
icon, follow the existing naming convention:
[[:File:Pact AA (Demonic Pacts League).png|Pact ID (Demonic Pacts League).png]].

